100
00:06:45,620 --> 00:06:46,450
Huh?

101
00:06:46,533 --> 00:06:47,363
What the devil?

102
00:06:47,446 --> 00:06:49,540
My Harmon is making that blood float.

103
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,153
Something's wrong here.

104
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:57,940
My Harmon is running off him
like rain off a raincoat.

105
00:06:58,340 --> 00:07:01,777
He's somehow repelling it and
pushing it into all of this blood.

106
00:07:01,860 --> 00:07:03,240
I don't understand it.

107
00:07:03,500 --> 00:07:05,580
His skin is acting like a ground.

108
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,824
Somehow it's behaving
just like Straitzo's scar.

109
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:13,940
My body and his body seem to be
repelling against one another.

110
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,230
Whoa!

111
