Come on, guys.

119
00:07:38,033 --> 00:07:39,291
This is funny stuff here.

120
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:43,200
But seriously, folks.

121
00:07:43,460 --> 00:07:45,497
Lucky thing I rolled
my wrist just in time.

122
00:07:45,580 --> 00:07:47,500
The beast's immune to Hamon.

123
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,440
That's not true, Jojo!

124
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:51,200
Don't you see?

125
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:53,417
It was Hamon that was protecting you!

126
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:57,324
It kept your body from being
completely absorbed into that thing!

127
00:07:57,420 --> 00:07:58,250
Idiot!

128
00:07:58,333 --> 00:08:00,218
It's like eating a blowfish for him!

129
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:04,120
