218
00:13:17,400 --> 00:13:18,230
They're...

219
00:13:18,313 --> 00:13:19,620
they're feeding on me!

220
00:13:21,220 --> 00:13:22,050
You...

221
00:13:22,133 --> 00:13:23,320
you son of a...

222
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:26,180
Got to stay focused!

223
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:32,100
I never once imagined a human such as
you would be born during my slumber.

224
00:13:38,140 --> 00:13:38,970
What?

225
00:13:49,760 --> 00:13:53,580
Joestar, leave the rest to me,
Colonel Rudolf von Stroheim.

226
00:13:54,260 --> 00:13:56,319
Opening the door will end all this.

227
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:59,440
