243
00:14:48,380 --> 00:14:50,137
You coward, cut off my leg.

244
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:52,897
It's the only way we're
getting that door open.

245
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:55,880
Maybe you're right, but
are you sure about this?

246
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:58,057
I mean, there has got
to be some other way.

247
00:14:58,140 --> 00:14:59,360
Do as I say.

248
00:14:59,660 --> 00:15:01,317
He's recovering, Joestar.

249
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:03,040
But I'm no doctor!

250
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:05,217
