251
00:15:05,300 --> 00:15:08,080
I am a proud servant of the Wehrmacht!

252
00:15:08,260 --> 00:15:11,789
I am prepared to do whatever
is required to fulfill my duty!

253
00:15:12,220 --> 00:15:14,737
I proudly give up my
leg for the Fatherland!

254
00:15:14,820 --> 00:15:16,820
Now hurry up before it's too late!

255
00:15:17,580 --> 00:15:18,410
Damn it!

256
00:15:18,493 --> 00:15:19,820
Do it now, Joestar!

257
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:23,580
Okay, I'll do it!

258
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:27,240
If you really want me to chop
it off, then off it goes!

259
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:29,217
I demand that you chop it off now!

260
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:30,130
Ow!

261
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:34,977
I figured this guy was just some bloated
power monger, but I gotta hand it to him.

262
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:36,180
